note rows writes the first count rows of Pascal's triangle into o, row after row (1, 1 1, 1 2 1, ...),
note and returns how many numbers it wrote.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/pascals-triangle
om2
fn rows count ulong o edit ulong * to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
